        "height": 336,
        "content": "## Handle manual investigation\n\nFor insufficient-confidence results, posts a Slack notice that manual investigation is required and responds to the original webhook that the investigation was logged."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "16fe5fd6-a34b-4b17-871b-4c096bd7f1c6",
